# Trivy suppressions — every entry needs a justification.
# DS-0002 (run as non-root) is now fixed: app/worker run as `node` (USER node),
# secrets are podman secrets at /run/secrets/* (tmpfs 0440, no bind mount UID clash),
# and the vpn sidecar is the only service that stays root (needs NET_ADMIN).
# DS0026 / AVD-DS-0026 (no HEALTHCHECK in Dockerfile): healthcheck is defined
# at compose level (compose.yaml app.healthcheck) to keep the image OCI-compatible.
# A Dockerfile HEALTHCHECK triggers podman/buildah WARN "HEALTHCHECK is not
# supported for OCI image format and will be ignored" and is ineffective; the
# compose healthcheck (curl -sf http://localhost:8080/) is the intentional
# OCI-compatible location.
AVD-DS-0026
